Error [E0998]: explicit mutable binding uses `name: Type :=`, not `name: Type =`
  --> tests/ui/missing_mut_call.jet:5:14
    |
  5 |      x: Int  = 1
    |              ^
 Why: when the type is written, immutable uses `::` and mutable uses `:=` (D-BIND4)
 Fix: write `x: <Type> :=` instead of `x: <Type> =`
